If you have a PlayStation 3 at home, you simply must add this masterpiece to your collection. The game plays quickly and in one breath, leaving you with a range of emotions and impressions. The developers ensured that the plot is not predictable, and the player is constantly overwhelmed by joy or sadness, pain or love, excitement or calm. These are normal human emotions that occur in our everyday lives.

Life Path
The game leaves a varied impression on players, as in some places, the meaning of events must be guessed. The gameplay is quite simple and chaotic, so those who enjoy frantic action and intricacies may become bored. However, those who are accustomed to pondering every detail can find answers to life's questions. A fairytale world Journey (download the torrent here) is very reminiscent of our everyday life, where enemies, obstacles, and various difficulties appear along the way. You won't die in the game, as the plot is guided by the principle that there is a way out of every situation.

Living life is not a walk in the park
